Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Verifying Amaya-Tapia Eq. 61 against Mehta-Shepard Eq. 10", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"28164a3e-0c86-41ea-b58b-3e49334818a4"],

Cell["\<\
Question: does Amaya-Tapia et al. (1997) Eq. (61) -- which the surrounding \
text identifies as equal to -Exp[2 I delta_AT] -- give the same physical \
phase shift as Mehta & Shepard (2005) Eq. (10) (Exp[2 I delta_MS]), once both \
are expressed as a function of the same dimensionless variable X = q*a2 (a2 = \
the standard two-body scattering length)? Both papers use the same \
hyperspherical mass convention (muref = m, single-particle mass), confirmed \
separately (Appendix A of Mehta & Shepard matches Amaya-Tapia's own Jacobi \
coordinates exactly).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"deb01350-454a-4d7b-b148-7eac3edd2c47"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Part 1: Amaya-Tapia Eq. 61 (their own delta-function coupling c = -1)\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"d9348da8-63bb-4c2e-9bec-8b276c55039b"],

Cell["\<\
Transcribed directly from the paper:
(R13+T13)(R23+T23) = [(1 - I(6 Sqrt[3]/Pi) q)(1 - I(2 Sqrt[3]/Pi) q)] / [(1 + \
I(6 Sqrt[3]/Pi) q)(1 + I(2 Sqrt[3]/Pi) q)]
The surrounding text states this quantity equals -Exp[2 I delta_AT].\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e9103de7-b626-49cb-92f9-b485d10b3ef7"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Eq61", "[", "q_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", 
        RowBox[{"I", "*", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"6", "*", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "3", "]"}], "/", "Pi"}]}], ")"}], "*", 
         "q"}]}], ")"}], "*", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", 
        RowBox[{"I", "*", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"2", "*", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "3", "]"}], "/", "Pi"}]}], ")"}], "*", 
         "q"}]}], ")"}]}], ")"}], " ", "/", " ", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"1", " ", "+", " ", 
        RowBox[{"I", "*", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"6", "*", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "3", "]"}], "/", "Pi"}]}], ")"}], "*", 
         "q"}]}], ")"}], "*", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"1", " ", "+", " ", 
        RowBox[{"I", "*", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"2", "*", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "3", "]"}], "/", "Pi"}]}], ")"}], "*", 
         "q"}]}], ")"}]}], ")"}]}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[24]:=",ExpressionUUID->"67ddecc6-4e46-473d-b8fd-0f129d3a1752"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"exp2dAT", "[", "q_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"-", 
    RowBox[{"Eq61", "[", "q", "]"}]}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[25]:=",ExpressionUUID->"964c8a0a-a303-46bd-b67b-f377aa504095"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"tanFromExp", "[", "E2d_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"-", "I"}], "*", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"E2d", " ", "-", " ", "1"}], ")"}], "/", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"E2d", " ", "+", " ", "1"}], ")"}]}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[26]:=",ExpressionUUID->"cc70ca75-4fce-4613-831b-2f867b6b113a"],

Cell["\<\
Amaya-Tapia give a formula, right before their Eq. (56), for the quantity 'a' \
appearing in their bound-pair momenta k1 = I a, k2 = -I a: a = Pi*Abs[c]/(6 \
Sqrt[2]). It is tempting to assume this 'a' IS the standard two-body \
scattering length -- that assumption is tested below.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2881429e-0a4d-43dd-b737-3e86af8fddf3"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"aAT", " ", "=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Pi", "/", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"6", "*", 
       RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "2", "]"}]}], ")"}]}]}], ";"}], "  ", 
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"c", "=", 
     RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"|", "c", "|"}], "=", "1"}]}], " ", "*)"}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[27]:=",ExpressionUUID->"f6b2493c-f05e-4b68-9adb-e68b6dad4d3f"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Part 2: Mehta-Shepard Eq. (10)", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"b52f9013-3f1a-46ad-b9ae-77fb51b64178"],

Cell["\<\
Exp[2 I delta_MS] = 1 - 8 Sqrt[6] X / (3 I X^2 + 4 Sqrt[6] X - 6 I), X = q*a2 \
directly in their own variable.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6b51105c-5a8c-4564-9d87-2be516de17b2"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Eq10MS", "[", "X_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", 
    RowBox[{"8", "*", 
     RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "6", "]"}], "*", 
     RowBox[{"X", "/", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"3", "*", "I", "*", 
         RowBox[{"X", "^", "2"}]}], " ", "+", " ", 
        RowBox[{"4", "*", 
         RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "6", "]"}], "*", "X"}], " ", "-", " ", 
        RowBox[{"6", "*", "I"}]}], ")"}]}]}]}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[28]:=",ExpressionUUID->"f9dc1fa3-9a2f-407f-8e7a-b1ca7073d8ec"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"tanMS", "[", "X_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"tanFromExp", "[", 
     RowBox[{"Eq10MS", "[", "X", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "//", " ", 
    "FullSimplify"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[29]:=",ExpressionUUID->"d4bf3932-5599-4ed3-bb8b-6203ef38f4ac"],

Cell["\<\
Sanity check: this should reduce, via Eq. (11) (Exp[2 I delta]-1 = 2 I \
tan(delta)/(1 - I tan(delta))), to Mehta-Shepard's own stated Eq. (12): q a2 \
tan(delta) = 4 Sqrt[2/3] (q a2)^2 / ((q a2)^2 - 2).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"07ea88da-1c02-4970-846c-a5f56f88fbbb"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<X*tan(delta_MS) = \>\"", ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
     RowBox[{"X", "*", 
      RowBox[{"tanMS", "[", "X", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[30]:=",ExpressionUUID->"e35c1793-cf14-4b5a-b69e-df65189a4446"],

Cell[BoxData[
 InterpretationBox[
  RowBox[{"\<\"X*tan(delta_MS) = \"\>", "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
   FractionBox[
    RowBox[{"4", " ", 
     SqrtBox[
      FractionBox["2", "3"]], " ", 
     SuperscriptBox["X", "2"]}], 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"-", "2"}], "+", 
     SuperscriptBox["X", "2"]}]]}],
  SequenceForm[
  "X*tan(delta_MS) = ", 4 
   Rational[2, 3]^Rational[1, 2] $CellContext`X^2/(-2 + $CellContext`X^2)],
  Editable->False]], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.993844968794808*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "During evaluation of \
In[30]:=",ExpressionUUID->"81f17743-0ecf-4a6c-8775-a7fe122d8d62"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<Eq (12) RHS directly = \>\"", ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
     RowBox[{"4", "*", 
      RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
       RowBox[{"2", "/", "3"}], "]"}], "*", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"X", "^", "2"}], "/", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"X", "^", "2"}], " ", "-", " ", "2"}], ")"}]}]}], "]"}]}], 
   "]"}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[31]:=",ExpressionUUID->"a85c8e8f-1eff-4f18-9098-ec9f61b5d43a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 InterpretationBox[
  RowBox[{"\<\"Eq (12) RHS directly = \"\>", "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
   FractionBox[
    RowBox[{"4", " ", 
     SqrtBox[
      FractionBox["2", "3"]], " ", 
     SuperscriptBox["X", "2"]}], 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"-", "2"}], "+", 
     SuperscriptBox["X", "2"]}]]}],
  SequenceForm[
  "Eq (12) RHS directly = ", 4 
   Rational[2, 3]^Rational[1, 2] $CellContext`X^2/(-2 + $CellContext`X^2)],
  Editable->False]], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.993844968811171*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "During evaluation of \
In[31]:=",ExpressionUUID->"850262cf-675d-4531-b712-ad4d62de5d84"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
If these two Print outputs match, the Eq. (10) transcription and the \
tanFromExp extraction are both validated against Mehta-Shepard's own internal \
consistency (Eq 10 -> Eq 12).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"723bbd39-843f-49d2-84fe-2e54a267b971"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Part 3: first attempt, treating aAT as the scattering length directly (X = \
q*aAT, q = X/aAT)\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"82d8f0fd-43c1-40b9-bc50-d31d89cff638"],

Cell["\<\
This is the FIRST substitution tried -- it does not work, and is kept here to \
show why.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a886cb3a-a4cd-4012-b862-cffc2e725ec3"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"tanAT", "[", "q_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"tanFromExp", "[", 
     RowBox[{"exp2dAT", "[", "q", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "//", " ", 
    "FullSimplify"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[32]:=",ExpressionUUID->"e70d9623-54ad-4335-9eec-662cec4ebb47"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"tanATinXNaive", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"tanAT", "[", 
     RowBox[{"X", "/", "aAT"}], "]"}], " ", "//", " ", "FullSimplify"}]}], 
  ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[33]:=",ExpressionUUID->"f976c071-25da-4a66-8af3-e1085f7628e8"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<(naive) X*tan(delta_AT) = \>\"", ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
     RowBox[{"X", "*", "tanATinXNaive"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[34]:=",ExpressionUUID->"fcf4f037-5b84-46a9-8aca-ecb0277685bf"],

Cell[BoxData[
 InterpretationBox[
  RowBox[{"\<\"(naive) X*tan(delta_AT) = \"\>", "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
   FractionBox[
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox["\[Pi]", "4"], "-", 
     RowBox[{"2592", " ", 
      SuperscriptBox["X", "2"]}]}], 
    RowBox[{"48", " ", 
     SqrtBox["6"], " ", 
     SuperscriptBox["\[Pi]", "2"]}]]}],
  SequenceForm[
  "(naive) X*tan(delta_AT) = ", Rational[1, 48] 6^Rational[-1, 2] 
   Pi^(-2) (Pi^4 - 2592 $CellContext`X^2)],
  Editable->False]], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.993844968862876*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "During evaluation of \
In[34]:=",ExpressionUUID->"26e452ea-3c3c-4a13-9983-7cc67d3046de"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<X*tan(delta_MS) = \>\"", ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
     RowBox[{"X", "*", 
      RowBox[{"tanMS", "[", "X", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[35]:=",ExpressionUUID->"0d8c92ff-9648-41c4-8d1c-e8b2985327cf"],

Cell[BoxData[
 InterpretationBox[
  RowBox[{"\<\"X*tan(delta_MS) = \"\>", "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
   FractionBox[
    RowBox[{"4", " ", 
     SqrtBox[
      FractionBox["2", "3"]], " ", 
     SuperscriptBox["X", "2"]}], 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"-", "2"}], "+", 
     SuperscriptBox["X", "2"]}]]}],
  SequenceForm[
  "X*tan(delta_MS) = ", 4 
   Rational[2, 3]^Rational[1, 2] $CellContext`X^2/(-2 + $CellContext`X^2)],
  Editable->False]], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.993844968869285*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "During evaluation of \
In[35]:=",ExpressionUUID->"67ff595b-5a67-4dce-b68d-0bcfade11f19"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
The naive result is LINEAR in X^2 with no pole, while X*tan(delta_MS) has a \
pole at X^2=2 (the resonance both papers discuss) -- structurally different \
functions. This is the discrepancy that motivated Part 4.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3c8fa0f3-d59f-440d-88ee-6cfc6301b66d"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Part 4: is aAT actually the scattering length, or its reciprocal?\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"467aef31-a7d9-4be5-b598-6101c9d9711d"],

Cell["\<\
Check via the two-body binding energy B2. Amaya-Tapia's own text (last page) \
states B2 = (Pi^2/36)(c^2/(2m)) for general c. Standard 1D delta-function \
result (bare coupling g, reduced mass mu2=m/2): B2 = mu2*g^2/2, scattering \
length a2std = -1/(mu2*g). Amaya-Tapia's own K=0 section relates their \
rescaled c to the bare coupling via c = (3/(Pi Sqrt[2]))*(2 m)*g.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4fa83b5c-f790-4234-8060-e1bfe6cf83a0"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"mu2", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"m", "/", "2"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[36]:=",ExpressionUUID->"26a4efee-405f-4664-a750-a4557dead97b"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"cOfG", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"3", "/", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"Pi", "*", 
        RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "2", "]"}]}], ")"}]}], ")"}], "*", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"2", "*", "m"}], ")"}], "*", "g"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[37]:=",ExpressionUUID->"1fc639ff-c6b5-40a9-9cbf-574d8b0b941b"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"a2std", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"-", "1"}], "/", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"mu2", "*", "g"}], ")"}]}], " ", "//", " ", "Simplify"}]}], 
  ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[38]:=",ExpressionUUID->"9132a351-c9e4-42a5-b79a-16d6e500a7b0"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"B2std", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"mu2", "*", 
       RowBox[{"g", "^", "2"}]}], ")"}], "/", "2"}], " ", "//", " ", 
    "Simplify"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[39]:=",ExpressionUUID->"dfcf5a19-ff5f-4d18-b210-df05999e99e1"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"aATofG", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"Pi", "*", 
       RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "cOfG", "]"}]}], ")"}], "/", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"6", "*", 
       RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "2", "]"}]}], ")"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[40]:=",ExpressionUUID->"5302825f-ea7c-4daf-820d-ada503fd9a90"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"B2ATofG", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Pi", "^", "2"}], "/", "36"}], ")"}], "*", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"cOfG", "^", "2"}], "/", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"2", "*", "m"}], ")"}]}], ")"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[41]:=",ExpressionUUID->"e2903a97-d4e5-4eb4-bcfe-f04fc8f3b77b"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<B2 (standard, bare g) = \>\"", ",", " ", "B2std", ",", 
    " ", "\"\<   B2 (Amaya-Tapia's own formula, bare g) = \>\"", ",", " ", 
    "B2ATofG", ",", " ", "\"\<   ratio = \>\"", ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
     RowBox[{"B2ATofG", "/", "B2std"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[42]:=",ExpressionUUID->"7808758c-f69f-462b-9cc9-39865f69ec22"],

Cell[BoxData[
 InterpretationBox[
  RowBox[{"\<\"B2 (standard, bare g) = \"\>", "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
   FractionBox[
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox["g", "2"], " ", "m"}], "4"], 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"   B2 (Amaya-Tapia's own formula, bare g) = \
\"\>", "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
   FractionBox[
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox["g", "2"], " ", "m"}], "4"], 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"   ratio = \"\>", "\[InvisibleSpace]", "1"}],
  SequenceForm[
  "B2 (standard, bare g) = ", Rational[1, 4] $CellContext`g^2 $CellContext`m, 
   "   B2 (Amaya-Tapia's own formula, bare g) = ", 
   Rational[1, 4] $CellContext`g^2 $CellContext`m, "   ratio = ", 1],
  Editable->False]], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9938449689828777`*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "During evaluation of \
In[42]:=",ExpressionUUID->"5a0262d5-2480-45ef-b01e-f5509fff9ffa"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<aAT (bare g) = \>\"", ",", " ", "aATofG", ",", 
    " ", "\"\<   a2std (bare g) = \>\"", ",", " ", "a2std", ",", 
    " ", "\"\<   aAT * a2std = \>\"", ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"aATofG", "*", "a2std"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Assumptions", " ", "->", " ", 
       RowBox[{"g", " ", "<", " ", "0"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";"}]], "Input",\

 CellLabel->"In[43]:=",ExpressionUUID->"10e96fda-89ff-4bc6-8bc7-e3248cb94fdb"],

Cell[BoxData[
 InterpretationBox[
  RowBox[{"\<\"aAT (bare g) = \"\>", "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox["1", "2"], " ", 
    RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
     RowBox[{"g", " ", "m"}], "]"}]}], 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"   a2std (bare g) = \"\>", "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
   RowBox[{"-", 
    FractionBox["2", 
     RowBox[{"g", " ", "m"}]]}], 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"   aAT * a2std = \"\>", "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
   FractionBox["1", 
    RowBox[{"Sign", "[", "m", "]"}]]}],
  SequenceForm[
  "aAT (bare g) = ", Rational[1, 2] Abs[$CellContext`g $CellContext`m], 
   "   a2std (bare g) = ", (-2) $CellContext`g^(-1)/$CellContext`m, 
   "   aAT * a2std = ", Sign[$CellContext`m]^(-1)],
  Editable->False]], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9938449689952393`*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "During evaluation of \
In[43]:=",ExpressionUUID->"45c8000d-edee-4739-9f4e-1535926e776d"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Result: B2 ratio = 1 (fully consistent), but aAT * a2std = 1 -- i.e. \
Amaya-Tapia's 'a' is the RECIPROCAL of the standard scattering length, not \
the scattering length itself.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8aa0a14d-1b7d-4b23-a02e-d2a4696bcf37"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Part 5: independent, from-scratch confirmation via the bound-state decay rate\
\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"7ba21a1d-b1fa-49e7-be69-38ef2dd7a614"],

Cell["\<\
Solve the two-body relative-motion Schrodinger equation directly, deriving \
the decay rate kappa from the delta-function jump condition (not assumed), \
and separately confirm that Amaya-Tapia's own k1 = I a, k2 = -I a IS this \
same kappa with no hidden factor.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1c75e2bf-cd02-4dae-bc55-0a94b9b6cced"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"kappaOfB2", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
    RowBox[{"2", "*", "mu2", "*", "B2"}], "]"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[44]:=",ExpressionUUID->"3687e7aa-1f54-4f9c-95f6-a1cc14235211"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<Step 1 (solve psi''=2 mu2 B2 psi for x!=0): kappa = \>\"", ",",
     " ", "kappaOfB2"}], "]"}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[45]:=",ExpressionUUID->"43daa125-6629-4b2f-ba74-32637d68357e"],

Cell[BoxData[
 InterpretationBox[
  RowBox[{"\<\"Step 1 (solve psi''=2 mu2 B2 psi for x!=0): kappa = \"\>", "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
   SqrtBox[
    RowBox[{"B2", " ", "m"}]]}],
  SequenceForm[
  "Step 1 (solve psi''=2 mu2 B2 psi for x!=0): kappa = ", ($CellContext`B2 \
$CellContext`m)^Rational[1, 2]],
  Editable->False]], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.993844969021266*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "During evaluation of \
In[45]:=",ExpressionUUID->"f15749f9-60e2-4df6-bec3-2035011c81b0"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Jump condition: integrating -(1/(2 mu2)) psi'' + g delta(x) psi = E psi \
across x=0 gives psi'(0+) - psi'(0-) = 2 mu2 g psi(0); for the symmetric \
bound state psi = A Exp[-kappa Abs[x]], this gives kappa = -mu2*g.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"206659b7-e764-42ed-8d0b-b606e7013c53"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"kappaOfG", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"-", "mu2"}], "*", "g"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[46]:=",ExpressionUUID->"9bb21865-3972-4f11-b0ba-0eff41075524"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<Step 2 (jump condition): kappa = \>\"", ",", " ", "kappaOfG", 
    ",", " ", "\"\<    kappa*a2std = \>\"", ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
     RowBox[{"kappaOfG", "*", "a2std"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[47]:=",ExpressionUUID->"db82a790-4f85-4899-b3b3-ecdf0738db16"],

Cell[BoxData[
 InterpretationBox[
  RowBox[{"\<\"Step 2 (jump condition): kappa = \"\>", "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
   RowBox[{"-", 
    FractionBox[
     RowBox[{"g", " ", "m"}], "2"]}], 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"    kappa*a2std = \"\>", "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
   "1"}],
  SequenceForm[
  "Step 2 (jump condition): kappa = ", 
   Rational[-1, 2] $CellContext`g $CellContext`m, "    kappa*a2std = ", 1],
  Editable->False]], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.993844969036165*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "During evaluation of \
In[47]:=",ExpressionUUID->"8edb7c20-a91f-4f96-99d1-9a770ff8f5ea"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"B2fromKappa", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Solve", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"kappaOfG", " ", "==", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
         RowBox[{"2", "*", "mu2", "*", "B2"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", "B2"}], 
      "]"}], "[", 
     RowBox[{"[", 
      RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "2"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "//", 
    " ", "FullSimplify"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[48]:=",ExpressionUUID->"c00b8638-f3f4-4fc1-a12b-3005c6151318"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TemplateBox[{
  "Solve", "nongen", 
   "\"There may be values of the parameters for which some or all solutions \
are not valid.\"", 2, 48, 1, 33641034056288688654, "Local"},
  "MessageTemplate",
  BaseStyle->"MSG"]], "Message",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.993844969084549*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "During evaluation of \
In[48]:=",ExpressionUUID->"592c7c00-6d9e-46d5-ad75-4da9c99695ba"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<Step 3: B2 (from kappa) = \>\"", ",", " ", "B2fromKappa", ",",
     " ", "\"\<   vs textbook mu2 g^2/2 = \>\"", ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
     RowBox[{"mu2", "*", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"g", "^", "2"}], "/", "2"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";"}]], "Input",\

 CellLabel->"In[49]:=",ExpressionUUID->"ab6b064e-dde0-4fa0-92c9-c25e35837371"],

Cell[BoxData[
 InterpretationBox[
  RowBox[{"\<\"Step 3: B2 (from kappa) = \"\>", "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
   FractionBox[
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox["g", "2"], " ", "m"}], "4"], 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"   vs textbook mu2 g^2/2 = \"\>", "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
   FractionBox[
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox["g", "2"], " ", "m"}], "4"]}],
  SequenceForm[
  "Step 3: B2 (from kappa) = ", 
   Rational[1, 4] $CellContext`g^2 $CellContext`m, 
   "   vs textbook mu2 g^2/2 = ", 
   Rational[1, 4] $CellContext`g^2 $CellContext`m],
  Editable->False]], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.993844969120124*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "During evaluation of \
In[49]:=",ExpressionUUID->"432ce25c-454a-4a16-9bcb-8226de27b93f"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Now check Amaya-Tapia's own k1=I a, k2=-I a directly: with the CM at rest \
(k1+k2=0), what is I(k1 x1 + k2 x2)?\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9fbf322a-c7e3-41c6-aae7-0cb543a6f02b"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"psiExponent", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"I", "*", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"I", "*", "a", "*", "x1"}], " ", "+", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"-", "I"}], "*", "a"}], ")"}], "*", "x2"}]}], ")"}]}], " ", 
    "//", " ", "Expand"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[50]:=",ExpressionUUID->"6250c7ce-34b1-43b9-9ce1-595ef105e559"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<Step 4: I(k1 x1 + k2 x2) = \>\"", ",", " ", "psiExponent", ",",
     " ", "\"\<  i.e. Psi ~ Exp[-a*(x1-x2)] -- AT's own 'a' IS the \
relative-coordinate decay rate kappa directly, no extra factor.\>\""}], "]"}],
   ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[51]:=",ExpressionUUID->"10d9176e-9722-4e7c-ab9b-23d213f313eb"],

Cell[BoxData[
 InterpretationBox[
  RowBox[{"\<\"Step 4: I(k1 x1 + k2 x2) = \"\>", "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"-", "a"}], " ", "x1"}], "+", 
    RowBox[{"a", " ", "x2"}]}], 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"  i.e. Psi ~ Exp[-a*(x1-x2)] -- AT's own 'a' IS \
the relative-coordinate decay rate kappa directly, no extra factor.\"\>"}],
  SequenceForm[
  "Step 4: I(k1 x1 + k2 x2) = ", -$CellContext`a $CellContext`x1 + \
$CellContext`a $CellContext`x2, 
   "  i.e. Psi ~ Exp[-a*(x1-x2)] -- AT's own 'a' IS the relative-coordinate \
decay rate kappa directly, no extra factor."],
  Editable->False]], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.993844969133067*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "During evaluation of \
In[51]:=",ExpressionUUID->"7ae4addf-7e0a-4ec5-922d-865049c58e5f"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<Step 5: aATofG = \>\"", ",", " ", "aATofG", ",", 
    " ", "\"\<   Abs[kappaOfG] = \>\"", ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
     RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "kappaOfG", "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
    " ", "\"\<   ratio = \>\"", ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
     RowBox[{"aATofG", "/", 
      RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "kappaOfG", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";"}]], "Input",\

 CellLabel->"In[52]:=",ExpressionUUID->"5d5f6b83-5225-40b9-895c-3a3720f3eeb2"],

Cell[BoxData[
 InterpretationBox[
  RowBox[{"\<\"Step 5: aATofG = \"\>", "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox["1", "2"], " ", 
    RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
     RowBox[{"g", " ", "m"}], "]"}]}], 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"   Abs[kappaOfG] = \"\>", "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox["1", "2"], " ", 
    RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
     RowBox[{"g", " ", "m"}], "]"}]}], 
   "\[InvisibleSpace]", "\<\"   ratio = \"\>", "\[InvisibleSpace]", "1"}],
  SequenceForm[
  "Step 5: aATofG = ", Rational[1, 2] Abs[$CellContext`g $CellContext`m], 
   "   Abs[kappaOfG] = ", Rational[1, 2] Abs[$CellContext`g $CellContext`m], 
   "   ratio = ", 1],
  Editable->False]], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.993844969143627*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "During evaluation of \
In[52]:=",ExpressionUUID->"3fd4da1a-c213-4060-b4d7-cde94a2dcbd5"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Every step above ties out with ratio 1 -- no floating factor of 2 anywhere in \
this chain. aAT = kappa = 1/a2std is confirmed three independent ways (B2 \
comparison, jump-condition kappa, and the k1=Ia/k2=-Ia wavefunction exponent \
directly).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"82e9fd4f-4043-4850-bbc9-3d23231a675c"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Part 6: corrected comparison, using X = q*a2std = q/aAT (i.e. q = X*aAT)\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"482ac6d7-46e5-4247-9ccd-0ab16aeb8333"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"tanATinX", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"tanAT", "[", 
     RowBox[{"X", "*", "aAT"}], "]"}], " ", "//", " ", "FullSimplify"}]}], 
  ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[53]:=",ExpressionUUID->"ed0ea58c-2be6-4739-a6da-d189252d622f"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<(corrected) tan(delta_AT) in terms of X=q*a2std: \>\"", ",", 
    " ", "tanATinX"}], "]"}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[54]:=",ExpressionUUID->"62c110f2-1783-49b4-b5d4-e1e8793d4c18"],

